  (text "U2 is on the slot as the plain card: /CE = /EXP, /OE = Q0," (at 22 222 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ae19e2d4-a858-55a6-950f-bad0fa07f63b))
  (text "/WE = /WE, A6:A0 and the data bus.  U1 is in none of" (at 22 226 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 723e3acf-d81a-5287-8d5a-99beb3f603dd))
  (text "its read or write paths (EXPANSION.md, \"Card timing\")." (at 22 230 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 8118a1a4-b0db-5f69-bfd1-710bbf317ede))
  (text "U1 holds U2's A14:A7 as the page, 0-255.  It clocks on" (at 22 234 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid eea80bc4-fb19-5218-ad94-a5014075afbc))
  (text "the rising edge of /WE and loads the data bus on a write" (at 22 238 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 7f374f4b-c3a6-5667-a16d-caceca794389))
  (text "to the card's offsets 78h-7Fh; it clears at power-up." (at 22 242 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 3492fab0-3ca7-5520-8bcd-840857039342))
  (text "Offsets 00h-77h of each page are memory (30720 bytes);" (at 22 246 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 58eee23d-65e1-5f28-b91e-c6098213e852))
  (text "78h-7Fh are reserved (the page write lands there too)." (at 22 250 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 77690c26-b44f-5739-809d-00f6a5db3620))
